WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:03.236
TONY HAWK:<i> I always felt
 a little misplaced.</i>

00:00:07.106 --> 00:00:08.774
<i> But I'd found this thing
 that I loved,</i>

00:00:09.208 --> 00:00:12.078
<i>and I had so much more to prove.</i>

00:00:13.012 --> 00:00:14.781
♪ (INSPIRATIONAL MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:17.650
<i> Whenever I would go,
 people would just be booing.</i>

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:19.151
(CROWD BOOING)

00:00:19.418 --> 00:00:20.920
The crowd was pretty rough.

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:21.954
You do it weird.

00:00:22.955 --> 00:00:26.392
He skated as if he was
being operated by a puppeteer.

00:00:26.492 --> 00:00:27.493
(LAUGHS)

00:00:28.394 --> 00:00:30.863
It reminded me that I can't even
fit in to the skateboard world.

00:00:31.564 --> 00:00:34.034
But the control he had
was insane.

00:00:37.603 --> 00:00:39.806
I was obsessed,
and I became a machine.

00:00:41.407 --> 00:00:45.145
That was the beginning of
his launch to become Tony Hawk.

00:00:48.113 --> 00:00:49.348
♪ (INTENSE MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:49.448 --> 00:00:51.284
HAWK:<i> I was just thrust
 into adulthood.</i>

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:53.453
<i> I never thought I'd be famous.</i>

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:55.622
But it's the worst drug.

00:00:56.356 --> 00:00:57.389
SPEAKER:<i> Watching Tony learn</i>

00:00:57.790 --> 00:00:59.692
<i> is more interesting
 than watching him land tricks.</i>

00:01:03.129 --> 00:01:04.697
HAWK:<i> I was truly alone...</i>

00:01:05.532 --> 00:01:07.333
<i> and I had to go make a change.</i>

00:01:08.167 --> 00:01:09.502
(CROWD CHEERS)

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:12.305
<i>I had not figured out how to be
 a husband or father</i>

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:14.407
because I didn't know
how to live in my own skin.

00:01:16.842 --> 00:01:19.044
SPEAKER 2:<i> Tony is
 always competing against Tony.</i>

00:01:19.378 --> 00:01:20.813
That's all just guts.

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:23.749
It inspires us
to do something different.

00:01:24.650 --> 00:01:26.252
HAWK:<i> I'm still trying
 to figure this out,</i>

00:01:26.352 --> 00:01:28.721
<i>and I never wanted to back down
 from a challenge.</i>

00:01:29.355 --> 00:01:33.426
♪ (MUSIC BUILDS) ♪

00:01:34.694 --> 00:01:35.862
<i> I'm not gonna quit.</i>

